程中會先提供菜單給你劃記，入場時就可以直接點餐，吃完才結帳，當天一直很猶豫是不是要雙主餐（拉麵加炒麵），後來沒錯就是雙主餐哈哈，醬油拉麵十分溫順，不會有過鹹的感覺，甚至可以喝完，預設的麵體是細麵，本來有另外一種麵體選擇但當天並沒有提供，豬叉燒是有嚼勁的但很不錯，雞叉燒比較一般，炒麵非常優質，醬汁的鹹甜搭配七味粉的微辣讓層次很多元，鍋氣加上完整包覆的醬汁更完整了整份炒麵，很慶幸當天有加點這類炒麵，溏心蛋中間偏上，沒有很溏但是醬汁的甜味有進去蛋裡面。",null,[0,262]]]],[null,1771896867000000,1771896867000000,"6 個月前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfbmZnNmtuQnFtNjh0S2drVklVdmRiQQ%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiMAoZQ0hfbmZnNmtuQnFtNjh0S2drVklVdmRiQRoTQ2d3SW80RDB6QVlRN283OHdBTQ\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwiF4JHVwtKWAxUCafUHHXnVCcwQ_2MImwEoEA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/14979237136206820722/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhrWmxwc1pITlRWVTVGVGxoQmVGZFVhM3BXVms1TVdqQmFTbVZyUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/14979237136206820722/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhrWmxwc1pITlRWVTVGVGxoQmVGZFVhM3BXVms1TVdqQmFTbVZyUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/14979237136206820722/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhrWmxwc1pITlRWVTVGVGxoQmVGZFVhM3BXVms1TVdqQmFTbVZyUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/14979237136206820722/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhrWmxwc1pITlRWVTVGVGxoQmVGZFVhM3BXVms1TVdqQmFTbVZyUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/14979237136206820722/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhrWmxwc1pITlRWVTVGVGxoQmVGZFVhM3BXVms1TVdqQmFTbVZyUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/14979237136206820722/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhrWmxwc1pITlRWVTVGVGxoQmVGZFVhM3BXVms1TVdqQmFTbVZyUlJBQhAA"],null,["zh-Hant"],[["謝謝你今天選擇我們🫶很開心我們聽到了，官方Line:@356iuajo\n請往這與小編分享更多，讓我們一起分享啦～",null,[0,56]]]],[null,null,18323,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xkZlpsZHNTVU5FTlhBeFdUa3pWVk5MWjBaSmVrRRAB!2m1